32241::$$$message_0256_0000_0000$$$::There's nothing strange happening at the docks.[lr]::
32242::$$$message_0256_0000_0001$$$::This is Lancer's territory. I doubt any suspicious characters would be able to get in under his watch.::
32243::$$$message_0256_0001_0000$$$::"Lancer isn't here.[lr]::
32244::$$$message_0256_0001_0001$$$::I was sure he'd be roasting something over a campfire with his tent up."::
32245::$$$message_0256_0002_0000$$$::"He certainly is a man who follows his impulses no matter where he goes. According to Taiga, he's made camp near the jetty."[wvs][move textoff=0 opacity=0 storage=007-矢印 cx=49 py=282 px=220 affine=(220,281,90,1,100,49,40)(210,291,90,1,255,49,40)(220,282,90,1,100,49,40)(220,281,90,1,100,49,40)(210,291,90,1,255,49,40)(220,282,90,1,100,49,40)(220,281,90,1,100,49,40)(210,291,90,1,255,49,40)(220,282,90,1,255,49,40) time=1000 cy=40 mag=1 deg=90 accel=0]::
32246::$$$message_0256_0003_0000$$$::Oh, over there.[wm canskip=0][lr]::
32247::$$$message_0256_0003_0001$$$::Not even locals venture out here when it isn't summer vacation, so it's virtually Lancer's hideout at this point.[lr]::
32248::$$$message_0256_0003_0002$$$::...It might even spawn an urban legend about a survivalist hermit on the outskirts of town.::
32249::$$$message_0256_0004_0000$$$::"The shoreline looks fine.[lr]::
32250::$$$message_0256_0004_0001$$$::Let's give the wild man his space and return to the city where we civilized folks belong."::
32251::$$$message_0256_0005_0000$$$::"Shirou, you misunderstand Lancer.[lr]::
32252::$$$message_0256_0005_0001$$$::He understands this era far better than I do, despite his conduct. He is a stalwart man, in both body and mind."::
32253::$$$message_0256_0006_0000$$$::...Can't argue with that. I can't help but respect Lancer on that front.[lr]::
32254::$$$message_0256_0006_0001$$$::Meaning...[lr]::
32255::$$$message_0256_0006_0002$$$::...that Saber must really like him if she doesn't deny that he's a survivalist.:�A